73434be40e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/35b8e307/uploads/origins/01c919a9-af60-48c7-b904-ae9d021ea58d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3306ad1fc4bb0cbb5064a5356f4e0afd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! I was wondering if you could draw my vtuber character Sivi? She's a guide of souls that was fired from her job for eating the souls she was suppose to guide. She's a house sparrow with pied spots and can be a bit bratty.  \n\nI really love your art and would like you to make Sivi fit your previous requests. Could you make her look cool and creepy and be eating one of the souls?\n\nThank you!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1molVB3R--IwcD1y_HwIaAb2UwunEnrne?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Maronrice_color/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d55064a8/uploads/origins/c142dde2-f166-4e08-97fa-fdd21ac13edb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5d2b7ed98840175fe5c84693321f2860", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d55064a8/uploads/origins/c142dde2-f166-4e08-97fa-fdd21ac13edb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5d2b7ed98840175fe5c84693321f2860, https://si.imgix.net/d55064a8/uploads/origins/c142dde2-f166-4e08-97fa-fdd21ac13edb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26aed8c784faf8ab980ca40f95ed6d55 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d55064a8/uploads/origins/c142dde2-f166-4e08-97fa-fdd21ac13edb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58c52402d0f6d7d5d14daefea052036e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello, It's Matcha Faun again! I LOVED THE ART YOU DID LAST TIME SO MUCH!!!! I was hoping to hire you to get a piece of art that is a bit more darker and has blood involved. \n\nI was hoping to get a piece with Matcha with some bloody tarot cards in one hand and a bloody drink in the other hand. I was also hoping to h